            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>康全電訊(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:8089:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/8089\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">8089-TW</a>)27日12:54下跌3.1元，股價跌停報28.1元，委買114,000張、委賣3,000張，成交2,885張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為寬頻通訊設備。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>康全電訊(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:8089:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/8089\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">8089-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌13.09%，櫃買市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>上漲1.58%，短期股價無明顯表現。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：+209 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：+209 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：0 張</li> <li>融資增減：-95 張</li> <li>融券增減：-61 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
